flow v0
columns side main stop

section "Issue stage"
text maintainer "A maintainer adds the first label" col=main
pill needs-preparation tone=agent
box issue-preparer "writes scope and criteria" tone=agent
pill needs-human col=stop row=issue-preparer tone=stop
pill ready col=main tone=done

section "Pull-request stage"
box implementer "codes, checks, opens the PR" tone=agent
pill blocked-impl "blocked" col=stop row=implementer tone=stop
pill needs-review col=main tone=agent
box reviewer "reviews the exact head SHA" tone=agent
pill blocked-rev "blocked" col=stop row=reviewer tone=stop
pill needs-security col=main tone=agent
box security-reviewer "checks secrets and permissions" tone=agent
pill blocked-sec "blocked" col=stop row=security-reviewer tone=stop
pill ready-to-merge col=main tone=done
pill needs-changes col=side row=ready-to-merge tone=rework
box integrator "updates base, checks, merges" col=main tone=agent
panel integrator-stops col=stop row=integrator tone=stop
  pill blocked-int "blocked"
  pill maintainer-merge "maintainer merge"
end merged "Merged · issue closed" col=main
panel person col=stop row=merged tone=stop
  strong "A stop"
  muted "needs-human label or Action needed comment"
  rule
  muted "a person decides and adds the trigger label of any role"
  muted "after blocked, the same role retries"

maintainer --> needs-preparation
needs-preparation --> issue-preparer
issue-preparer --> ready : prepared
issue-preparer --> needs-human tone=stop : stop
ready --> implementer
implementer --> needs-review : opens PR · handed-off
implementer --> blocked-impl tone=stop : blocked
needs-review --> reviewer
reviewer --> needs-security : approves
reviewer --> blocked-rev tone=stop : blocked
reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework to=top.2 : requests changes
needs-security --> security-reviewer
security-reviewer --> ready-to-merge : approves
security-reviewer --> blocked-sec tone=stop : blocked
security-reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework to=top.3 : requests changes
ready-to-merge -.-> needs-changes tone=rework : on-conflict · launcher
ready-to-merge --> integrator
integrator --> merged : merges
integrator --> needs-changes tone=rework : requests changes
integrator --> integrator-stops tone=stop : stop
needs-changes --> implementer tone=rework from=top.1 to=left label=end : revises same PR
